---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { getDictionary } from '../i18n';

const dict = getDictionary('es');
---

<Base
  dict={dict}
  title="404 · Página no encontrada / Page not found · Osmar Liera"
  description="Esta ruta no existe. This route does not exist."
  path="/404/"
  noindex
  motion={false}
>
  <section class="not-found container" aria-labelledby="nf-title">
    <p class="not-found__trace mono" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="not-found__step">tool_call</span> resolve_route(<span class="not-found__path">“?”</span>) →
      <span class="not-found__err">404</span>
    </p>
    <h1 class="not-found__title" id="nf-title">
      404 · <span lang="es">Esta ruta no existe.</span>
      <span class="not-found__en" lang="en">This route does not exist.</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="not-found__cols">
      <div lang="es">
        <p>El agente buscó y no encontró nada aquí. Puede que la dirección haya cambiado con el nuevo sitio.</p>
        <ul class="not-found__links" role="list">
          <li><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/">Ir al inicio <Icon name="arrow-right" size={18} /></a></li>
          <li><a class="btn" href="/cv/">Ver CV</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div lang="en">
        <p>The agent looked and found nothing here. The address may have changed with the new site.</p>
        <ul class="not-found__links" role="list">
          <li><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/en/">Go to home <Icon name="arrow-right" size={18} /></a></li>
          <li><a class="btn" href="/en/cv/">View résumé</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .not-found {
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 9rem);
  }

  .not-found__trace {
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.9rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .not-found__step {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .not-found__path {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .not-found__err {
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  .not-found__title {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    max-width: 16ch;
  }

  .not-found__en {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.4em;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.55em;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .not-found__cols {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  @media (min-width: 800px) {
    .not-found__cols {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .not-found__links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
</style>
